# Issue Loop Engineering

At session start:

1. Run `gh issue list --repo tanbamboo/rusql --label agent-ready --json number,title,labels`
2. If none: update HANDOFF.md and stop
3. Pick highest priority (`priority:P0` > P1 > P2 > P3)
4. Read full issue body as spec; follow docs/en/workflows/spec-to-ship.md

On completion:

1. Run sensors: `cargo fmt`, `clippy`, `test`, `harness-validate`
2. Open PR with `Closes #N`
3. Remove `agent-ready` label; add `needs-review`
4. Update HANDOFF.md with next issue

## File Boundaries

Never modify files outside the issue's declared boundaries.

## Single Area

Prefer one `area:*` label per PR.
